<div id="urduTextPath">امام محمد باقر (ع)/ہے قصد کچھ فضائلِ باقر رقم کروں</div>

<p>hai qasd kuch fazael-e baquar raqam karoo'n<br />
tahreer mojizaate imam-e umam karoo'n<br />
likhne me misle qaama-e sar ajz qam karoo'n<br />
loho qalam ko gheerate loho qalam karoo'n</p>

<p>anwaare mojizaat se raushan kitaab ho<br />
khaama shuaa ho toh waraq e aaftaab ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ek din pidar ki godh me tha woh falak maqaam<br />
ek shia laya nazre dirham paye imaam<br />
sajjad ke huzoor woh dirham rakhe tamaam<br />
dirham se khelne lagaa farzand-e nekh naam</p>

<p>kya aql di thi khaaliq-e roz-e hisaab ne<br />
dirham zamee'n pe phaink diya us janaab ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tab doudh kar mohib ne wo dirham utha liya<br />
aur us ko darmiyaan-e dirham phir milaa diya<br />
baquar ne chunke phir wahi dirham judaa kiya<br />
tifli me thi ye aap pe taaeed-e kibriyaa</p>

<p>likha hai teen baar yehi maajra huva<br />
us dam mohib ko sheh ke tahayyur bada huva<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abid se ki ye shia-e abid ne iltejaa<br />
irshaad aap kijiye ye maajra hai kya<br />
sheh ne kaha ye aadat-e tifli na jaan'na<br />
hoga imaam baad hamare ye mehlaqaa</p>

<p>dirham ye ek ghazbi-o maal-e haraam hai<br />
kyu'n kar ise qubool kare ye imaam hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baquar pe woh nisaar hua paau choom choom<br />
tifli se sheh ke ilm-e khuda daad ki thi dhoom<br />
baquar ki sharah karte hai ye khaas aur umoom<br />
yaani hai woh imam shigafindah-e uloom</p>

<p>tha koi raaz-e ghaib na sheh se chupaa hua<br />
uqdaa woh kaun tha jo na hazrat se waa hua<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likhta hu ab shahadat-e maula-e khoosh nihaad<br />
tha bas ke zaid ibn-e hassan ko hasad ziyaad<br />
rakhta tha bughz aap se wo baani -e fasaad<br />
karta tha majliso'n me hiqaarat se sheh ko yaad</p>

<p>tha munharif woh baquar-e aali muqaam se<br />
karta tha id'duae imamat imaam se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sougand khaa ke zaid ne is waqt ye kahaa<br />
daawaa na ab karoonga imamat ka mutleqaa<br />
phir sooe mulk e shaam wo mal'oo'n rawaa'n hua<br />
abdul malik se jaake kahaa sab ye maajraa</p>

<p>aakhir ko ye kaha ke hamaare gumaan me<br />
baquar sa ab nahi'n koyi saare jahaan me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abdul malik ko bughz-o khusumat hui ziyaad<br />
kya kya na usne shahe umam se kiye fisaad<br />
akhir imam ko ye likhaa az rahe anaad<br />
mai bhejtaa hoon zaid ko aye shahe khush nihaad</p>

<p>ibne hassan ko laayeq-e takreem kijiye<br />
taadeeb kijiye use taaleem kijiye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aur ek zeen taabiye jis me kiya tha sam<br />
hum raahe zaid bhejaa baraaye shahe umam<br />
aaya jo zaid rubaru-e shaahe ba karam<br />
shah bole hai jo qasd tera jaante hai hum</p>

<p>aye ibne amm ye zulmo sitam tu ne kya kiya<br />
is zeen me hai taabiye zehr-e dagha kiya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>is zeen par mai hota hu daanista ab sawaar<br />
bande ko kya mashiyat-e eezad me eqtiyaar<br />
baandha wo zeen asp pe allah re inkesaar<br />
aur zeb-e raahwaar hua shaahe ba weqaar</p>

<p>maut apni pasand ki raza-e ilaah me<br />
us zaher ne nafooz kiya jism-e shah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sheh ne muraaje-at ki sawaari se aah jab<br />
bas aashkaar hogaye aasaar-e maut sab<br />
farmaaya teen roz ke hum mehmaa'n hai ab<br />
jaffar ko laao aur kafan bhi karo talab</p>

<p>talib kafan ke badle hai is pairahan ke hum<br />
kaabe ka tawaaf karte the jis ko pahen ke hum<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>laaye wo jaama hazrat-e sadiq bachashm-e tarr<br />
hazrat ne pyaar karke kahaa unko aye pisar<br />
jaata hoo'n mai jahaa'n se tu hotaa hai bepidar<br />
duniya se aaj kartaa hoo'n uqbaa ka mai safar</p>

<p>pyare pidar ke marne ka tum gham na khaaiyo<br />
mazloomi-e hussain pe aansoo bhaaiyo<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>